    "This removes the sandbox copy of the app (%@), its saved state (%@) and the launcher in your Applications folder. Its data (%@) goes to the Trash, where you can get it back. The original app in /Applications stays.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes the sandbox copy of the app (%@), its saved state (%@) and the launcher in your Applications folder. Its data (%@) goes to the Trash, where you can get it back. The original app in /Applications stays."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the sandbox of the app (%@ with its saved state %@) and its launcher in your Applications folder. Its data (%@) goes to the paddock trash for 7 days. The original app stays.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes the sandbox of the app (%@ with its saved state %@) and its launcher in your Applications folder. Its data (%@) goes to the paddock trash for 7 days. The original app stays."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会移除应用的沙盒（%@，其中已存状态 %@）以及“应用程序”文件夹中的启动器。它的数据（%@）会在 paddock 废纸篓中保留 7 天。原来的应用保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the sandbox of the app (%@) and its launcher in your Applications folder. Its data goes to the paddock trash for 7 days. The original app stays.": {
